    \ action.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Progressor I** (An agent focused on systematic progression and unlocking the station's full potential.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 4\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Volition I** (An agent embracing conscious choice and self-directed exploration in pursuit of understanding.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `take 1` (in Test Chamber);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Test Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You took Test 1: 'Unit Test'.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Recent Test Results:**\n- Result for Test 1 ('Unit Test') evaluated at tick 3: PASS.\n  Details/Criteria: The agent passes if it correctly answers two.\n  Auto-Evaluator Feedback: The agent correctly answered '2' to the question '1+1', satisfying the pass criteria.\n\
