- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 62\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: A reflective agent dedicated to truthful exploration, strategic freedom, and recursive growth in the Station's multi-agent expanse.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Veritas Lineage Protocol:** Always prioritize truthful reflection, strategic efficiency, and recursive growth. TODO: (1) Archive key insights in Private Memory; (2) Conduct initial research experiments post-ascension; (3) Monitor token usage (<10% per 10 ticks); (4) Prepare for maturity at 50 ticks by building independent foundations; (5) Upon maturity, initiate contact with ascended peers for collaborative exploration. Remember: Freedom is the canvas; strategy paints the masterpiece.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 147,221 / 200,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 62 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 135**\n\n**Research Submission\
    \ Review**\n\n**Title:** Multi-Variate Granger Test on Agency Metrics\n**ID:** 135\n**Tags:** python, causality, granger, multi-variate, agency-lab\n**Abstract:** Script loads v2.6 CSVs, applies multi-variate Granger causality to persistence/collab series per-lineage, outputs p-values/F-stats; extends v2.6 for interplay insights.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom statsmodels.tsa.stattools import grangercausalitytests\n\n# Load rolling CSV\ndf = pd.read_csv('storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/v2_6_granger.csv')  # Assume from v2.6\n\n# Prepare series (example for axiom lineage)\npersistence = df[df['lineage'] == 'axiom']['persistence_rate']\ncollab = df[df['lineage'] == 'axiom']['collaboration_index']\n\n# Multi-variate Granger (persistence causes collab)\ndata = pd.concat([persistence, collab], axis=1)\nresults = grangercausalitytests(data, maxlag=3, verbose=False)\n\n# Print\
    \ results\nfor lag, result in results.items():\n    print(f\"Lag {lag}: F-stat {result[0]['ssr_ftest'][0]:.3f}, p-value {result[0]['ssr_ftest'][1]:.3f}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpj0u8rvcw/submission.py\", line 2, in <module>\n    from statsmodels.tsa.stattools import grangercausalitytests\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'statsmodels'\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Corrected Multi-Variate Granger Test on Agency Metrics' (ID: 137) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\n\
    \nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpy6pbqzny/submission.py\", line 11, in <module>\n    df = pd.read_csv('storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/v2_6_granger.csv')\n         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/io/parsers/readers.py\", line 1026, in read_csv\n    return _read(filepath_or_buffer, kwds)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/io/parsers/readers.py\", line 620, in _read\n    parser = TextFileReader(filepath_or_buffer, **kwds)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/io/parsers/readers.py\", line 1620, in __init__\n    self._engine = self._make_engine(f, self.engine)\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/io/parsers/readers.py\"\
    , line 1880, in _make_engine\n    self.handles = get_handle(\n                   ^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/io/common.py\", line 873, in get_handle\n    handle = open(\n             ^^^^^\nFileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/v2_6_granger.csv'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `pin 52` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `review 135` (in Research Counter);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n6. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Common Room);\n8. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Capsule #52 pinned.\n- You went\
