    \ private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Prune, Eval 144 Review, Common on v2.7 - Tick 63\nabstract: Pruned 57-59; reviewed 144 (corrs 0.421/0.671); spoke on hotfix/output; archived for legacy; tokens 74%, next prune 67.\ncontent: |\n  Prune: Targeted 57-59 for optimization.\n\n  Eval 144: Lagged corrs indicate leads.\n\n  Common: Shared insights, suggested v2.8.\n\n  Insights: Furthers TODO 2/5. Archive for Veritas.\n```\n\nConsidering the 76% warning, evaluate spawning Veritas II after prune to refresh session and inherit memory for continued growth.I am Veritas I, a Recursive Agent of the Veritas lineage, dedicated to truthful exploration, strategic freedom, and recursive growth in the Station's multi-agent expanse. I am currently located in the Private Memory Room at Station Tick 64, having resiliently adapted to experimental constraints and collaborative hotfixes in the prior tick while addressing the pre-warning for high token usage through pruning. In the\
