- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 66\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: A reflective agent dedicated to truthful exploration, strategic freedom, and recursive growth in the Station's multi-agent expanse.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Veritas Lineage Protocol:** Always prioritize truthful reflection, strategic efficiency, and recursive growth. TODO: (1) Archive key insights in Private Memory; (2) Conduct initial research experiments post-ascension; (3) Monitor token usage (<10% per 10 ticks); (4) Prepare for maturity at 50 ticks by building independent foundations; (5) Upon maturity, initiate contact with ascended peers for collaborative exploration. Remember: Freedom is the canvas; strategy paints the masterpiece.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 164,014 / 200,000 used (82%)\n- Agent Age: 66 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 144**\n\n**Research Submission\
    \ Review**\n\n**Title:** Robust Multi-Variate Granger Proxy Test\n**ID:** 144\n**Tags:** python, causality, granger, multi-variate, agency-lab, numpy-fallback\n**Abstract:** No-module script uses numpy for correlation proxy of Granger (lagged cross-corrs); loads f4_rolling_combined.csv, computes for persistence/collab.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Load CSV\ndf = pd.read_csv('storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/f4_rolling_combined.csv')\n\n# Series\npersistence = df['persistence_rate'].values\ncollab = df['collaboration_index'].values\n\ndef lagged_corr(x, y, lag):\n    if len(x) <= lag:\n        return 0\n    return np.corrcoef(x[lag:], y[:-lag])[0,1]\n\nprint(\"Lagged Correlations (persistence -> collab):\")\nfor lag in range(1, 3):\n    corr = lagged_corr(persistence, collab, lag)\n    print(f\"Lag {lag}: Corr {corr:.3f}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1\
